    "homeType": "SINGLE_FAMILY",
    "description": "On a beautiful tree-lined street in Mission Terrace, this elegant and newly renovated Marina Style 2 bedroom, 1-bathroom single-family home, blends timeless period details with modern updates. The front door opens to a light-filled living room featuring dual-paned bay windows, a wood-burning fireplace, refinished hardwood floors, and newly painted interiors that flow throughout. An elegant formal dining room with built-in cabinetry leads to the renovated kitchen with newly installed stainless steel appliances. Two generously sized bedrooms and a renovated full bath complete the main level. The lower level offers a garden-side bonus rooms, which offers flexibility for family and friends, and/or can be used as a private office. This level includes a versatile 1-car garage with parking, laundry, and abundant storage. The large lot size affords a beautiful, level rear garden with mature fruit trees, including oranges, apples, and lemons, making it a perfect retreat for relaxing or entertaining. All of this is found in hip Mission Terrace, one of San Francisco's best-kept secrets. The central location offers easy access to BART, freeways, Balboa Park, and shopping/dining along Mission Street, Ocean Avenue, and in adjacent Glen Park."
  },
